  "decision_conditions": [
    "The Applicant has failed to demonstrate that the development will safeguard existing trees adjacent to the site's boundaries and further fails to demonstrate protection for the long-term retention of the trees, which are considered of merit within the Hillingdon Court Area of Special Local Character. The proposal is, therefore, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2021) and Policies DMHB 14 and DMHB5 of the Hillingdon Local Plan: Part Two - Development Management Policies (2020)."
